; ── Materials ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
; LIVERY BODY COLOUR (#184): dark industrial green (task #39's intent), MATTE so it
; reads as solid paint instead of the old washed-out cream that looked white in-game.
; To match the real CeDo machine, change Mat_yellow + Mat_hood albedo here — it is a
; one-line swap. (Reference photos weren't in the project, so this is the stopgap.)
